{"ref":"BDB, כּוֹבַע","hw":"כּוֹבַע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹבַע</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> helmet <strong>(</strong>√ dub.; NH <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹבַע</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹבְעָא</span> <em>turban;</em> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹבַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.24\">Ez 23:24</a><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.10\">Ez 27:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹבָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.5\">38:5</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">כּ֫וֹבַע</span> (Ew<sup>§ 213 f.</sup>) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.5\">1 S 17:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.17\">Is 59:17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹבָעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.4\">Je 46:4</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.14\">2 Ch 26:14</a>;—<em>helmet</em>, of bronze <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ נְחשֶׁת עַל־רֹאשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.5\">1 S 17:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.4\">Je 46:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.10\">Ez 27:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.5\">38:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.14\">2 Ch 26:14</a>; fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּלְבַּשׁ צְדָקָה כַּשִּׁרְיָן וְכ׳ יְשׁוּעָה בְּרֹאשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.17\">Is 59:17</a>.","next":"BDB, כָּוָה","prev":"BDB, כּוּב"}